OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 21 MAY
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe BBC Symphony Orchestra
OL,6,     Gconducted by Elena Schwarz
OL,7,     Gperforms Adams's pulsating
OL,8,     GHarmonielehre, Du Yun's Hundred
OL,9,     GHeads and, with soloist Steven
OL,10,     GBanks, Billy Child's Diaspora.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Full Moon on Progress
OL,12,     FSt
OL,13,     GDr Rommi Smith examines a key
OL,14,     Gmoment in the life and work of
OL,15,     Gfive Black female musicians.
OL,16,     GToday she considers the political
OL,17,     Gawakening of Nina Simone.
